What was done: the university's knowledge plane investigated, traced the bad announcement to a downstream customer of an upstream provider (AS1), and that provider has already withdrawn the bogus route and blocked further re-advertisements. ACM's real provider (AS2) and ACM itself have been notified by the operators. You don't need to contact anyone — it's been handled upstream.

